00:14:15,833 --> 00:14:19,937
That has to be the reason why they asked
those of us from Tokyo to come here.

258
00:14:20,020 --> 00:14:21,491
Kugisaki, you're awesome.

259
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:26,397
The name of the mole is...

260
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:27,360
Mekumaru!

261
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,419
Oh, there you are.

262
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:33,595
Today is the last day for
you to turn in your notebook.

263
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,230
Makamaru?

264
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:40,400
Sorry, Miwa.

265
00:14:40,620 --> 00:14:42,326
I'm going to sleep for a bit.

266
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,551
Please, take my notebook.

267
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:47,740
It's on my desk. Going to sleep?

268
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:49,685
It's still only the afternoon.

269
00:14:57,920 --> 00:14:59,640
You really did go to sleep.

270
00:15:00,060 --> 00:15:02,707
I wonder where the real
Makamaru actually is.

271
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:09,480
Mechamaru's actual body, Kokichi
Mode, is in the basement.

272
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:12,337
Now, it's not like he's suspicious.

273
00:15:12,420 --> 00:15:14,297
It's more that everyone else wasn't.

274
00:15:14,380 --> 00:15:17,262
So the process of elimination
leaves us with him.

275
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:33,517
Mechamaru's technique
is puppet manipulation.

276
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:38,247
Thanks to his heavenly pact, he can
manipulate puppets throughout all of Japan.

277
00:15:38,800 --> 00:15:40,957
And if he has puppets we don't know about,

278
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:44,628
then it would be easy for him
to work as a mole if he wanted.

279
00:15:45,020 --> 00:15:45,850
No way.

280
00:15:45,933 --> 00:15:48,097
How can you miss a puppet
that size being a mole?

281
00:15:48,180 --> 00:15:50,945
By using puppets the size
of a fly or mosquito.

282
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:52,470
Oh, yeah.

283
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:53,953
I didn't think of that.

284
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:57,430
In there.

285
00:16:01,140 --> 00:16:02,220
They have arrived.

286
00:16:18,300 --> 00:16:19,280
Wrong... Rune?

287
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:22,285
He knows that we're after him.

288
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,157
But on the other hand...

289
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:26,887
Now we're certain that
the mole is Mechamaru.

290
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:34,430
You're late.

291
00:16:34,513 --> 00:16:35,417
I've been waiting.

292
00:16:35,500 --> 00:16:37,265
I thought you forgot about me.

293
00:16:37,780 --> 00:16:39,545
How could we forget about you?

294
00:16:40,020 --> 00:16:43,785
You're personally familiar with
the terrifying nature of a pact.

295
00:16:44,620 --> 00:16:46,260
You always smell so moldy.

296
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:47,498
I hate coming here.

297
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:49,297
And these are enemies.

298
00:16:49,380 --> 00:16:51,217
Why don't we just kill him already?

299
00:16:51,300 --> 00:16:53,380
No, we can't kill him yet, Mahito.

300
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:57,660
He agreed to cooperate with
us and provide information.

301
00:16:58,260 --> 00:17:02,580
In exchange, we agreed to use your
idle transfiguration to fix his body.

302
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:05,980
That's the pact we all forged. Remember.

303
00:17:08,340 --> 00:17:10,752
Killing him comes right after fixing him.

304
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:16,297
I wanted him to do some
work for us in Shibuya, too.

305
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:17,240
Such a shame.

306
00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:20,617
You're the ones who broke
our pact first when you said

307
00:17:20,700 --> 00:17:23,994
we won't lay a hand on the
people from the Kyoto School.

308
00:17:24,300 --> 00:17:25,877
Konami's the one who did that.

309
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:28,431
Don't blame us for what somebody else did.

310
00:17:29,040 --> 00:17:31,040
I won't argue with cursed spirits.

311
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:33,400
Fix me, scumbag. Hurry up.

312
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:39,769
Maybe I'll get carried away and
turn him into a caterpillar.

313
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:40,930
Mahito,

314
00:17:41,013 --> 00:17:42,977
pacts that are forged with
others are very different

315
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:45,648
from the pacts that are
placed upon oneself.

316
00:17:45,900 --> 00:17:49,960
The first aspect of a break is the
uncertain nature of the penalty.

317
00:17:50,540 --> 00:17:52,537
If you break a pact with yourself,

318
00:17:52,620 --> 00:17:54,677
whatever you were able
to gain in terms of the

319
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:57,517
improvement to your own
ability is lost forever?

320
00:17:57,600 --> 00:18:01,424
But this time you can't break it,
because if you break this pact,

321
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:06,032
then we have no idea as to what kind
of disaster will eventually befall us.

322
00:18:07,740 --> 00:18:08,677
Yeah, yeah.

323
00:18:08,760 --> 00:18:11,980
You're actually lower than
a scumbag, so be grateful.

324
00:18:14,140 --> 00:18:15,375
Idle Transfiguration.

325
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:48,180
You're no fun at all.

326
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:50,322
You should celebrate a bit more.

327
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:55,224
I'll do that after I'm
finished with my promise.

328
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:56,570
Hmm.

329
00:18:56,880 --> 00:18:57,710
Hmm.

330
00:18:57,793 --> 00:18:58,623
I suppose that's fair.

331
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,070
All right.

332
00:19:00,520 --> 00:19:01,755
Shall we get started?

333
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:12,120
Want my help?

334
00:19:12,340 --> 00:19:13,280
Don't you dare.

335
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,600
He's my toy now.

336
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:45,550
He escaped?

337
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:50,897
Well, it's not like we needed
to kill him as part of our pact.

338
00:19:50,980 --> 00:19:52,568
It's pretty boring, though.

339
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:56,711
I wanted to have a match, not
go hunting for him, you know?

340
00:20:11,820 --> 00:20:14,200
Now that's more like it, Puppet Master!

341
00:20:23,220 --> 00:20:26,177
so you've been making something
like this in secret the whole time?

342
00:20:26,260 --> 00:20:30,677
yes you had a reason to be a shut-in
after all he's inside it right?

343
00:20:30,760 --> 00:20:34,340
he wouldn't want me to
touch him after all the

344
00:20:34,980 --> 00:20:39,060
Cockpit, the seat of
his soul, is the head.

345
00:20:39,620 --> 00:20:40,914
Expansion rate normal.

346
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:42,807
Perception feedback severed.

347
00:20:43,500 --> 00:20:44,960
Someone lowered a veil.

348
00:20:45,460 --> 00:20:46,600
Must be Code.

349
00:20:47,580 --> 00:20:50,097
It's not just attempting
to trap me inside.

350
00:20:50,180 --> 00:20:51,768
It's cutting off my signal.

351
00:20:52,940 --> 00:20:55,480
This won't be as easy
as it was for Satoru.

352
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:57,060
That's right.

353
00:20:57,340 --> 00:20:59,700
My victory condition is Satoru Gojo.

354
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:04,245
I have to use any means necessary
to get in contact with Satoru.

355
00:21:04,340 --> 00:21:06,297
and tell him about the Shibuya plot.

356
00:21:06,380 --> 00:21:08,145
Then I'll have him protect me.

357
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:12,421
But even if I want to focus on
Code, the one who lowered this veil,

358
00:21:12,720 --> 00:21:14,720
Mahito is too dangerous to ignore.

359
00:21:15,100 --> 00:21:17,120
I'll have to exorcise him first.

360
00:21:19,620 --> 00:21:20,500
Go ahead.

361
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:22,240
Don't mind me at all.

362
00:21:23,420 --> 00:21:25,120
I'm still at a disadvantage,

363
00:21:26,080 --> 00:21:28,500
but I have a chance to win.

364
00:21:34,580 --> 00:21:36,020
I've seen it all.

365
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:38,680
I have all the time I was bound.

366
00:21:39,100 --> 00:21:41,806
All the cursed energy I
gained from that time.

367
00:21:42,180 --> 00:21:44,280
I won't hold anything back.

368
00:21:52,820 --> 00:21:54,500
Charge! One year!

369
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:56,740
Burn him now! Nikamaru!

370
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:01,980
Hold your cannon!

371
00:22:11,380 --> 00:22:13,580
I don't know.

372
00:22:25,100 --> 00:22:27,900
Thank you.

373
00:22:43,940 --> 00:22:47,040
I'll never forget about it.

374
00:22:47,420 --> 00:22:50,880
I'll never forget about it.

375
00:22:54,780 --> 00:23:00,380
If you want to know what I want,

376
00:23:01,040 --> 00:23:05,857
I'll still believe my life.

377
00:23:05,940 --> 00:23:08,997
I don't think I'm going to die.

378
00:23:09,080 --> 00:23:11,700
I'm going to die.

379
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:17,260
I'm going to get you.

380
00:23:19,600 --> 00:23:20,430
I'm going to die.

381
00:23:20,513 --> 00:23:24,080
You can always be the same.

382
00:23:27,140 --> 00:23:28,540
I'm going to die.

383
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:31,070
I'm going to die.

384
00:23:31,153 --> 00:23:32,120
I'm going to die.

385
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:43,697
I decided I'd never tell anyone about
the things I truly want to keep secret.

386
00:23:43,780 --> 00:23:46,337
After I wrote what type of boy I like
in my notebook back in grade school?

387
00:23:46,420 --> 00:23:47,949
and let everyone find out!

388
00:23:48,600 --> 00:23:50,247
Next time, Evening Festival!

389
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:51,518
What did you write?

390
00:23:51,700 --> 00:23:52,530
I don't mind.

391
00:23:52,640 --> 00:23:54,464
He does seem like he'd be fast.
